    m_Localized: ENABLE/DISABLE GK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1156324417654784
    m_Localized: ENTER TEXT...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875371048960
    m_Localized: welcome to this tutorial! for the first stage, you will learn the
      basics of movement. Use WASD to move, left-shift to sprint, space to jump,
      left-control to slide, and e to dash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574912
    m_Localized: you can add force to the ball by sliding into it by pressing left
      control. this is useful for tackling the ball out of opponents or to deflect
      a low-driven shot. now, slide the ball into the barrier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574913
    m_Localized: next, you will learn how to dribble. use your right mouse button
      to trigger a dribble move, which will make the ball follow the direction of
      your player. useful for cutting through defenses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574914
    m_Localized: now you will learn how to shoot. hold the left mouse button to charge
      up a kick. you can add height by looking up before you kick the ball.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574915
    m_Localized: now that you know how to kick, you will learn how to add spin onto
      the ball. simply flick the ball with your mouse before you shoot to make the
      ball spin in that direction. spin shots are faster than non-spin shots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574916
    m_Localized: Each position has two unique abilities (except for midfield positions).
      Starting with cf, the powerkick ability allows you to shoot with a greater
      power, provided that you time the shooting bar well. to get a perfect timing,
      you must release when the bar touches the white part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574917
    m_Localized: cf's next ability "speedster" allows you to move faster for a short
      duration. this can be used to make a quick run through the defences to create
      plays.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574918
    m_Localized: As a midfielder (LMF/RMF), you will have the ability to "trap" the
      ball, or stop the ball's velocity entirely. to use this, you should get near
      the ball and use the ability. useful for catching high passes or fast moving
      balls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574919
    m_Localized: your next ability as a midfielder allows you to perform a roulette
      move, or a spin move that drags the ball with your player. performing this
      move gives you a slight speed boost as well. to use it, you must be the last
      kicker and be close enough to the ball.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574920
    m_Localized: as a defender (CB), you have access to two defensive moves. the
      first one is called "kill", and to use it you must aim at a player to temporarily
      stun them. this can be extremely effective at stopping attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574921
    m_Localized: Your next defensive ability is called "deflect", and it allows you
      to deflect balls in the air. this can be used to block high passes or shots.
      really powerful if used well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574922
    m_Localized: as a gk, you won't have any abilities. however, you are able to
      dive and deflect the ball upon contact. press q to dive in the direction that
      your player is moving, and jump before diving to cover the air.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574923
    m_Localized: You can also press T to catch the ball when you are grounded. You
      must make sure that you are on top of the ball to ensure that you can actually
      catch the ball. Useful for completely stopping attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574924
    m_Localized: "once the ball is in your hands, you have two options: drop kick
      the ball or roll the ball. in order to perform a drop kick, you will use your
      left mouse button to charge up your drop kick\u2014the same as charging up
      a regular kick. drop kicks can go further and higher than a roll pass."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574925
    m_Localized: To perform a roll pass, you must have the ball in your hands. Then,
      hold your right mouse button (the same as dribbling) to charge up a roll pass
      then let go of the button to release the ball. This will execute a short but
      more controllable pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875425574926
    m_Localized: Congratulations on passing the tutorial! Now that you have learned
      the basics, you can either play a full online match with other people or continue
      to develop your skills by joining a practice server. There's a lot more hidden
      techs and cool things that this tutorial has not covered. Good luck, and have
      fun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769216
    m_Localized: welcome to this tutorial! for the first stage, you will learn the
      basics of movement. Use the left joystick to walk and push it further to sprint.
      On the right, you can click on the three buttons to jump, slide, and dash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769217
    m_Localized: you can add force to the ball by sliding into it by pressing the
      slide button. this is useful for tackling the ball out of opponents or to deflect
      a low-driven shot. now, slide the ball into the barrier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769218
    m_Localized: next, you will learn how to dribble. use the right joystick with
      the "D" button and hold on it to trigger a dribble move. depending on the direction
      of the joystick, the ball will move in that direction. useful for cutting through
      defenses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769219
    m_Localized: now you will learn how to shoot. hold the joystick with the "S"
      button to charge up a kick. you can height by moving your camera up before
      you kick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769220
    m_Localized: now that you know how to kick, you will learn how to add spin onto
      the ball. just like dribbling, the direction of the joystick will determine
      the direction of the spin. also, spin shots are faster than non-spin shots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769221
    m_Localized: Each position has two unique abilities. Starting with cf, the powerkick
      ability allows you to shoot with a greater power, provided that you time the
      shooting bar well. to get a perfect timing, you must release when the bar touches
      the white part. you can activiate it by pressing the "L" button twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769222
    m_Localized: cf's next ability "speedster" allows you to move faster for a short
      duration. this can be used to make a quick run through the defences to create
      plays. You can activiate it by pressing the "R" button twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769223
    m_Localized: As a midfielder (LMF/RMF), you will have the ability to "trap" the
      ball, or stop the ball's velocity entirely. to use this, you should get near
      the ball and use the ability. useful for catching high passes or fast moving
      balls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769224
    m_Localized: your next ability as a midfielder allows you to perform a roulette
      move, or a spin move that drags the ball with your player. performing this
      move gives you a slight speed boost as well. to use it, you must be the last
      kicker and be close enough to the ball.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769225
    m_Localized: '  as a defender (CB), you have access to two defensive moves. the
      first one is called "kill", and to use it you must aim at a player to temporarily
      stun them. this can be extremely effective at stopping attacks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769226
    m_Localized: Your next defensive ability is called "deflect", and it allows you
      to deflect balls in the air. this can be used to block high passes or shots.
      really powerful if used well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769227
    m_Localized: as a gk, you won't have any abilities. however, you are able to
      dive and deflect the ball upon contact. Press the "D" button to dive in the
      direction that your player is moving, and jump before diving to cover the air.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769228
    m_Localized: You can also press the "C" button to catch the ball when you are
      grounded. Useful for completely stopping attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769229
    m_Localized: 'once the ball is in your hands, you have two options: drop kick
      the ball or roll the ball. in order to perform a drop kick, you will have to
      perform a regular kick (joystick with the "S" button). drop kicks can go further
      and higher than a roll pass.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769230
    m_Localized: To perform a roll pass, you must have the ball in your hands. Then,
      perform a dribble shot. This will execute a short but more controllable pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1162875429769231
    m_Localized: Congratulations on passing the tutorial! Now that you have learned
      the basics, you can either play a full online match with other people or continue
      to develop your skills by joining a practice server. There's a lot more hidden
      techs and cool things that this tutorial has not covered. Good luck, and have
      fun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
